These files are not part of Savane, but are used with it.

gettext.m4 iconv.m4 intlmacos.m4 nls.m4, po.m4, progtest.m4
  come from gettext-0.21.1 (po.m4 is modified in Savane).

host-cpu-c-abi.m4 lib-ld.m4 lib-link.m4 lib-prefix.m4
  come from gettext-0.21.1 (from gnulib directories).

ax_perl_module_version.m4 comes from autoconf-archive-2023.02.20.

ax_gen_changelog.m4 was written for Savane, but isn't considered
a part of it for consistency with the other files in this directory.
